00:57:47,778 --> 00:57:48,695
Where are you now?

821
00:57:49,404 --> 00:57:50,905
I met with Hwal-sung.

822
00:57:50,906 --> 00:57:51,906
He seems completely clueless about it...

823
00:57:51,907 --> 00:57:53,240
That's not the issue.

824
00:57:53,241 --> 00:57:55,159
But seriously, this guy has lied so much.

825
00:57:55,160 --> 00:57:56,078
How can I believe what he says?

826
00:57:56,870 --> 00:57:58,246
I think Da-rae's been kidnapped.

827
00:57:58,497 --> 00:57:59,206
What?

828
00:58:01,291 --> 00:58:03,000
Da-rae...

829
00:58:03,001 --> 00:58:05,003
I think Da-rae's been kidnapped!

830
00:58:06,379 --> 00:58:08,381
What? Da-rae is what?

831
00:58:09,549 --> 00:58:11,967
I'm heading
to the police station now,

832
00:58:11,968 --> 00:58:13,678
so hurry and come, okay?

833
00:58:58,723 --> 00:58:59,724
Da-rae.

834
00:59:03,061 --> 00:59:04,229
You did well.

835
00:59:15,615 --> 00:59:17,450
SPECIAL THANKS TO ACTOR KIM SEUNG-WOOK

836
00:59:33,633 --> 00:59:36,802
MAD CONCRETE DREAMS

837
00:59:36,803 --> 00:59:38,220
Was she really kidnapped?

838
00:59:38,221 --> 00:59:39,972
You don't think Yi-gyeong did it, do you?

839
00:59:39,973 --> 00:59:41,807
There's nothing left to break.

840
00:59:41,808 --> 00:59:43,017
I'm already at rock bottom.

841
00:59:43,018 --> 00:59:44,685
As broken as I've been,

842
00:59:44,686 --> 00:59:46,520
your mom and dad need to be broken too.

843
00:59:46,521 --> 00:59:48,189
Honey, Da-rae knows everything now.

844
00:59:48,190 --> 00:59:50,232
Sir, how old is your child?

845
00:59:50,233 --> 00:59:51,609
Still in the womb.

846
00:59:51,610 --> 00:59:53,153
Do you have
newborn supplies too?

847
00:59:53,403 --> 00:59:54,528
Who are you?

848
00:59:54,529 --> 00:59:55,863
Why are you doing this to me?

849
00:59:55,864 --> 00:59:57,573
No!

850
00:59:57,574 --> 00:59:59,534
Hwal-sung,
you need to die today.

851
00:59:59,784 --> 01:00:02,036
I admit to killing Min Hwal-sung,
Jeon Yi-gyeong's husband,

852
01:00:02,037 --> 01:00:04,456
and disposing of the body.

